&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Define the strategic direction for B Impact as the primary platform through which organisations engage with B Lab&#39;s standards, working closely with Product and Technology to shape business priorities and customer value.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Identify opportunities to expand standards adoption across customer segments, markets, products, services, and strategic partnerships.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
